<title>UK: Avis sets $1.65 bln asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>Avis sets $1.65 bln asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aesop Funding II LLC, administered by Avis Rent-a-Car Inc, has launched a $1.65 billion two-tranche asset-backed bond, lead manager Lehman Brothers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>* * * * TRANCHE 1 * * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $800 MLN	COUPON     6.22	LEGAL MAT   20.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 EXP MAT     20.OCT.00</p>
<p> FULL FEES  51 BP     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+39 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	THREE-YEAR AVERAGE LIFE</p>
<p>* * * * TRANCHE 2 * * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $850 MLN	COUPON     6.40	LEGAL MAT   20.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.984375 EXP MAT     20.OCT.02</p>
<p> FULL FEES  51 BP     REOFFER    99.984375 SPREAD	+45 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	FIVE-YEAR AVERAGE LIFE</p>
<p>* * * * COMMON TERMS * * * *</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS     1M+1K     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    21 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
